{"name": "Rubber Bird", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Rub through his troubles in this quirky <strong>2-3 hour adventure</strong>. No game over or time limit, take your time to discover colorful islands and their inhabitants across various <strong>short levels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/9062d5c63406da086aaefab5e9598014.poster.avif?t=1780741897\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/9062d5c63406da086aaefab5e9598014.webm?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/9062d5c63406da086aaefab5e9598014.mp4?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level brings its own <strong>platforming</strong> twists that you'll overcome using Rub's long and elastic arms. No worries! There\u2019s no health bar or level restarts, so you can enjoy the experience at your own pace. <strong>Collectibles</strong> are scattered throughout each level for those seeking an extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/9495f2b9b0c00594031b4a3233b22d39.poster.avif?t=1780741897\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/9495f2b9b0c00594031b4a3233b22d39.webm?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/9495f2b9b0c00594031b4a3233b22d39.mp4?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rub is stronger than anyone and he's able to grab almost anything! Because of this, some birds have requests for him, but being delicate might be a problem... <strong>Chaotic situations</strong> can unfold very quickly in this <strong>physics-based</strong> environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/1343371f9a4ecd0415356912ff793c96.poster.avif?t=1780741897\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/1343371f9a4ecd0415356912ff793c96.webm?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/1343371f9a4ecd0415356912ff793c96.mp4?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grill food, make music, or fight ghosts in short but intense <strong>minigames</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/ea5f3235afcb4b024b9a8b68a69ab739.poster.avif?t=1780741897\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/ea5f3235afcb4b024b9a8b68a69ab739.webm?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/ea5f3235afcb4b024b9a8b68a69ab739.mp4?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the beach to the mountains, through the city and the ocean floor, Rub  journeys through a variety of small levels. Luckily, you'll have a <strong>world map</strong> if you feel like revisiting anything you might have missed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/d1bc41c7e4476cfb9715277f25dcd4b0.poster.avif?t=1780741897\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/d1bc41c7e4476cfb9715277f25dcd4b0.webm?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/extras/d1bc41c7e4476cfb9715277f25dcd4b0.mp4?t=1780741897\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk with all kinds of funny birds, help them and uncover dark secrets along this adventure.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Meet Rub the bird and help him answer the big question: why does he have arms? Jump, stretch, grab, throw, and mess up everything around you in this bite-sized physics-based platformer.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537090/3198e4ea43a327be7f269dd0ff9355de2571b9f4/header.jpg?t=1780741897", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Physics", "Collectathon", "Comedy", "Cute", "Linear"], "developers": "Outretaupe", "publishers": "Outretaupe", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4537090", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/vMooIwi3190", "first_seen": 1787672531.555697}